### ============================================
### BARBEARIA CASTILHO API - TESTES
### ============================================
### Como usar:
### 1. Instale a extensao "REST Client" no VS Code
### 2. Inicie o servidor: npm start
### 3. Faca login e substitua seu_token_aqui pelo JWT retornado
### ============================================

### Registrar novo cliente
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Joao Silva",
  "email": "joao@test.com",
  "phone": "11999999999",
  "password": "123456"
}

###

### Login
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "joao@test.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

###

### Solicitar recuperacao de conta
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "joao@test.com"
}

###

### Redefinir senha com codigo recebido
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "123456",
  "newPassword": "123456"
}

###

### Perfil do usuario logado
GET http://localhost:5000/api/user/profile
Authorization: Bearer seu_token_aqui

###

### Alterar senha
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/user/password
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer seu_token_aqui

{
  "currentPassword": "123456",
  "newPassword": "654321"
}

###

### Listar servicos
GET http://localhost:5000/api/services
Authorization: Bearer seu_token_aqui

###

### Listar barbeiros disponiveis
GET http://localhost:5000/api/services/barbers
Authorization: Bearer seu_token_aqui

###

### Agendamentos do cliente
GET http://localhost:5000/api/appointments/customer
Authorization: Bearer seu_token_aqui

###

### Agendamentos do barbeiro
GET http://localhost:5000/api/appointments/barber
Authorization: Bearer seu_token_aqui

###

### Disponibilidade de horarios
GET http://localhost:5000/api/appointments/availability?barberId=UUID_BARBEIRO&serviceId=UUID_SERVICO&date=2026-04-15
Authorization: Bearer seu_token_aqui

###

### Criar agendamento
POST http://localhost:5000/api/appointments/book
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer seu_token_aqui

{
  "barberId": "uuid-do-barbeiro",
  "serviceId": "uuid-do-servico",
  "date": "2026-04-15",
  "time": "10:00",
  "notes": ""
}

###

### Atualizar status do agendamento
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/appointments/uuid-do-agendamento/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer seu_token_aqui

{
  "status": "CONFIRMED"
}

###

### Estatisticas admin
GET http://localhost:5000/api/admin/statistics
Authorization: Bearer seu_token_admin_aqui

###

### Distribuicao de lucros
GET http://localhost:5000/api/admin/profit-distribution?startDate=2026-01-01&endDate=2026-12-31
Authorization: Bearer seu_token_admin_aqui

###

### Lancamentos de lucro
GET http://localhost:5000/api/admin/profit-entries
Authorization: Bearer seu_token_admin_aqui

###

### Criar lancamento de lucro
POST http://localhost:5000/api/admin/profit-entries
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer seu_token_admin_aqui

{
  "source": "Corte masculino",
  "date": "2026-04-15",
  "amount": 50,
  "commissionPercentage": 50,
  "barberId": "uuid-do-barbeiro",
  "paymentMethod": "Dinheiro",
  "notes": ""
}

###

### Listar barbeiros (admin)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/admin/barbers
Authorization: Bearer seu_token_admin_aqui

###

### Criar barbeiro (admin)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/admin/barbers
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer seu_token_admin_aqui

{
  "name": "Carlos Barbeiro",
  "email": "carlos@test.com",
  "phone": "11988887777",
  "password": "123456",
  "specialization": "Barbeiro"
}

###

### Agenda geral (admin)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/admin/appointments
Authorization: Bearer seu_token_admin_aqui

###

### Criar servico (admin)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/services
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer seu_token_admin_aqui

{
  "name": "Corte masculino",
  "description": "Corte padrao",
  "duration": 30,
  "price": 45
}

###

### Testar notificacao de conta criada (dev)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/notifications/test
Content-Type: application/json
X-Notification-Test-Key: uma-chave-para-testar-envios

{
  "name": "Cliente Teste",
  "email": "cliente@test.com",
  "phone": "11999999999"
}

###

### Testar notificacao de recuperacao (dev)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/notifications/recovery-test
Content-Type: application/json
X-Notification-Test-Key: uma-chave-para-testar-envios

{
  "name": "Cliente Teste",
  "email": "cliente@test.com",
  "phone": "11999999999",
  "code": "123456"
}
